  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Overview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>THIS MOD WILL NOT LOAD WITH ECHOES OF TARKOV – REQUISITIONS, AS THESE MAGS WILL BE INCLUDED THERE IN THE NEXT MAJOR UPDATE.</strong></p>\n<p>This mod adds various Magpul GEN M3 P-MAGs with coloured baseplates for easier identification when dropped or in the inventory; think mag tape, but a bit more permanent.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UGqp4Xt.gif\" alt=\"UGqp4Xt.gif\" /></p>\n<p>GIF credit goes to Kiyuno813, thanks!</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>THIS MOD WILL NOT LOAD WITH ECHOES OF TARKOV – REQUISITIONS, AS THESE MAGS WILL BE INCLUDED THERE IN THE NEXT MAJOR UPDATE.</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgur.com/vKRw58b.gif\" alt=\"vKRw58b.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Contents</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Currently this mod contains:</p>\n<p>- 5.56x45 30-Rounders in Red, Orange, Yellow, Green, Blue, Purple, Pink, FDE, Olive Drab &amp; White.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A0kAWoV.png\" alt=\"A0kAWoV.png\" />z</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Planned</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Planned Additions:</p>\n<p>- 5.56x45 40-rounders in all colours.</p>\n<p>- 5.45x39 30-rounders in all colours.</p>\n<p>- 7.62x39 30-rounders in all colours.</p></div></div></div>\n",
